{"bbc14d56-b0c4-457d-ae6c-a795b818f833":{"id":"bbc14d56-b0c4-457d-ae6c-a795b818f833","title":"Osekkai Joshi, Koi o Suru","altTitle":"The meddlesome girl, falling in love","description":"Gamo Chitose adalah si \"gadis tukang ikut campur\" yang kerjaannya cuma sibuk ngurusin urusan asmara orang lain. Suatu hari, atas permintaan sahabatnya, Nagisa, Chitose pergi buat nganterin surat ke cowok dari kelas sebelah yang namanya Makita. Tapi siapa sangka, justru malah dia sendiri yang dideketin sama cowok itu—!?\n\n\"N-nggak mungkin banget! Nagisa jauh lebih imut, tau!? Aku mah... mana mungkin hal kayak gitu kejadian!!\"\n\nInilah kisah komedi romantis masa muda yang penuh suka duka tentang si \"sahabat tukang ikut campur\" yang tiba-tiba saja memulai kisah cintanya sendiri!","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/bbc14d56-b0c4-457d-ae6c-a795b818f833/c0436c7c-8a8a-4ffa-b162-73b26d90ee2e.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","es-la","tl","id","pt-br"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.77,"follows":8738,"listAt":"2026-10-24T07:00:04.799Z","chapters":[{"id":"eba8f60c-f919-4632-922b-a5d6567a045d","number":"42","volume":"2","title":"A Busybody Girl, Getting Asked Questions","lang":"en","pages":4,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T02:17:59+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0949b546-0616-4053-ae09-d7e759b4814f","number":"41","volume":"2","title":"A Busybody Girl, Just Can't Stand It","lang":"en","pages":3,"createdAt":"2026-10-14T03:35:23+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"02aa89d2-4d39-4966-8ea9-91cc65da6861","number":"40","volume":"2","title":"A Busybody Girl, Being Intimidating","lang":"en","pages":3,"createdAt":"2026-10-11T02:08:22+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"06850de4-07c3-4d4f-87f9-be9cb5b543f7","number":"39","volume":"2","title":"A Busybody Girl, Reconfirming It","lang":"en","pages":6,"createdAt":"2026-10-07T04:02:40+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"74ff1a2d-ce9