eath, when all Sheena wants to do is stop it… \n\nA story of two girls' innocent wishes, found in a world next to death.","year":2018,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Girls' Love","Drama","Fantasy","Tragedy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/0c44cf39-3d6c-4472-815b-9e163613cfe9/bda1d964-69fb-4438-a312-cf9a5fbae77a.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["uk","pt-br","es-la","en","fr","tr","ru","id"],"lane":"manga","rating":9.48,"follows":50336,"listAt":"2026-10-22T01:04:02.231Z","chapters":[{"id":"f1eda706-4623-4555-a33d-3f393640951a","number":"42.5","volume":"9","title":"Volume 9 Extras","lang":"en","pages":10,"createdAt":"2026-09-29T06:45:36+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0f2bb35f-53ec-4955-bb1e-b66ec6d8b34e","number":"42","volume":"9","title":"My Love","lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2026-08-31T14:35:56+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"eead7a60-a0b6-496c-9382-13a0aa42c8af","number":"41","volume":"9","title":"Liar","lang":"en","pages":35,"createdAt":"2026-07-07T18:25:26+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"f7e9a754-e534-4f20-b7ae-cbae6f240154","number":"40","volume":"9","title":"Mama","lang":"en","pages":29,"createdAt":"2026-06-03T21:07:52+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"afb2d90f-868d-46a3-bffc-a5ebb842e995","number":"39","volume":"9","title":"Until the End","lang":"en","pages":40,"createdAt":"2026-05-25T07:15:31+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"48dbcd3c-8a6f-414a-a4d3-8b950db32438","number":"39","volume":"9","title":"Right Until the Very End","lang":"en","pages":39,"createdAt":"2026-05-29T00:52:01+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b77675e1-7088-4bcb-b067-e7fda38df17e","number":"38.7","volume":"8","title":"Anime Adaptation Decision Special Announcement","lang":"en","pages":7,"createdAt":"2025-03-11T11:35:53+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"af70093e-917d-42f7-b17b-ba7af1cf82ff","number":"38.6","volume":"8","title":"Volume 8 Extras","lang":"en","pages":17,"createdAt":"2025-05-05T13:14:21+00:00","baked":fa