ly different sides called \"mania\" and \"depression\"... Eat, work, sleep, wake up. They are unable to live a normal life, but they reach towards the will to live. \nA stepfamily story from an author with bipolar disorder.","year":2024,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"24","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Psychological","Drama","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/f66cd885-b5f0-4b3e-b157-2e8dd92a6ca1/69b99452-07a9-42a9-a7cb-3345f07426b2.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","fr"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.43,"follows":789,"listAt":"2026-10-24T07:00:04.800Z","chapters":[{"id":"992efdb1-0d20-457c-9842-2aea6b17dd86","number":"4","volume":"1","title":"One Year Later","lang":"en","pages":30,"createdAt":"2026-10-21T20:49:32+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d75becd8-f5cd-44a5-86c2-fc97cfbf9593","number":"3","volume":"1","title":"Cohabitation","lang":"en","pages":25,"createdAt":"2026-03-30T20:41:14+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"60e98ca6-4ed4-460f-a6e6-9889ddf86aae","number":"2","volume":"1","title":"Depression and Mania","lang":"en","pages":38,"createdAt":"2026-03-08T17:04:00+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"00f81874-291d-4425-8455-df5a4a804e97","number":"1","volume":"1","title":"A Different Person","lang":"en","pages":48,"createdAt":"2026-02-07T01:10:35+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":4,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-22T01:05:30.433Z"}}
